OL,3,AUS House votes to hold billionaire
OL,4,AEpstein associate Leon Black in
OL,5,Acontempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US House of Representatives has
OL,8,Fagreed to hold billionaire Leon Black
OL,9,Fin contempt of Congress for defying a
OL,10,Flegal summons related to its
OL,11,Finvestigation into convicted sex
OL,12,Foffender Jeffrey Epstein.
OL,14,FBlack, who had business ties to
OL,15,FEpstein, did not comply with a subpoena
OL,16,Fordering him to appear before the House
OL,17,FOversight Committee earlier this month
OL,18,Fand share documents related to Epstein.
OL,20,FLawyers for Black, who has sued over
OL,21,Fthe summons, called the contempt move
OL,22,F"outrageous".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
