OL,3,AUS House votes to hold billionaire
OL,4,AEpstein associate Leon Black in
OL,5,Acontempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter passage of the measure holding
OL,8,FBlack in contempt, Oversight Committee
OL,9,FChairman James Comer said: "No-one is
OL,10,Fabove the law. We will continue to seek
OL,11,Ftransparency for the American people
OL,12,Fand justice for survivors."
